1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,000
For 1,500 years, a temple has hung off a cliff.
一座庙·悬在崖上1500年

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,300
Held up by just 27 wooden beams.
只靠27根木梁撑着

4
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,600
75 meters up — nothing but air below.
75米高·脚下全是空

5
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:11,000
Meet Shanxi's Hanging Temple.
这就是山西悬空寺

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,400
Its slim stilts? Mostly for show.
细木柱·多半是装饰

7
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,700
The real load rides beams sunk into rock.
真撑住的·是嵌进岩石的横梁

8
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:18,100
One temple honors three faiths at once.
一寺·佛道儒三教同奉

9
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:20,500
Built high to escape the floods below.
建这么高·为躲山下洪水

10
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:23,200
★ Expert Tip: Go at opening — the plank paths let very few up at a time.
内行提示：开门就去·栈道限流·人极少

11
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:26,000
Would you dare cross its cliff-edge walkway?
你敢走那段悬空栈道吗？评论区见
